 ],
 "synopsis": "Swara Baby Products Ltd. has announced its initial public offering of up to ₹800 crore, consisting of a fresh issue of up to ₹500 crore and an offer for sale of up to ₹300 crore by existing shareholders Brainbees Solutions and Anadya Bon Merchari LLP. The price band has been fixed at ₹105 to ₹111 per share. Subscription will open on 2 December 2026 and close on 4 December 2026, with anchor bidding beginning on 1 December. The proceeds will be used to fund a new manufacturing facility in Pithampur, Madhya Pradesh, repay borrowings, and support general corporate requirements and future acquisitions. JM Financial and Avendus Capital are managing the issue.",
